    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description><![CDATA[## What is jcode?

jcode is a high-performance coding agent harness written in Rust. It runs coding
agents in your terminal against the model providers you configure.

## Usage

The package installs the `jcode` command. Open a new terminal after installing so the
PATH change takes effect, then run `jcode` in a project directory.
]]></description>
    <summary>High-performance coding agent harness written in Rust</summary>
